</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>window.__NUXT__=(function(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z){return {layout:"default",data:[{post:{lang_code:"en",bg_image:{},image:{},web_site_link:b,video:b,title:a,small_desc:a,desc:a,meta_title:"YGA – Why does YGA exist and what does it do?",meta_desc:"Click to find out more about YGA, a non-governmental organization in Turkey that connects young people with science and benefits education!",page:[{"section-slug":"section-1",content:"\u003Cdiv class=\"banners-text\"\u003E\u003Ch5\u003E\u003C\u002Fh5\u003E \u003Ch1 style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\"\u003EWhy does YGA exist and what does it do?\u003C\u002Fh1\u003E \u003Ch2 style=\"transform: translate(0px, 0px);\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fh2\u003E \u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(10, 38, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003EYGA raises double-winged youths who help us look to the future with hope.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\u002Fo:p\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(10, 38, 57); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"\u003EFor YGA, a non-profit and non-governmental organization established in Turkey, “being double-winged” means not only being conscientious enough to design projects beneficial to humanity but also being adequately equipped to accomplish projects.\u003Co:p\u003E\u003C\u002Fo:p\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E \u003Cdiv class=\"button_su large orange mt-3\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"su_button_circle desplode-circle\" style=\"left: 82px; top: -3.09375px;\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E \u003Ca class=\"button_su_inner\" href=\"\u002Fen\u002Fabout-us\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"button_text_container\"\u003EExamine in Detail\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E \u003Cdiv class=\"img-container\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fyga.org.tr\u002Fcms\u002Fimages\u002Fpages\u002Fhomepage.webp\" style=\"transform-origin: 50% 50%; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E"}]}}],fetch:{},error:b,state:{language:a,formData:{},image:a,formData2:{},formData3:{},formClass:a,programSelect:{},questData:{},i18n:{routeParams:{}}},serverRendered:true,routePath:"\u002Fen",config:{_app:{basePath:"\u002F",assetsPath:"\u002F_nuxt\u002F",cdnURL:b},http:{}},__i18n:{langs:{en:{message:{ygaprogramlari:"YGA Programs",bannertext:"Social innovation program raising the double-winged youth of the future ",indir:"Download Brochure",basvur:"Register","paylaş":d,tumPlatformlarda:"All Channels ",tab1:"Overview",tab2:"Program Details",tab3:"FAQ",tab4:"Pricing",tab5:"Videos",nedenyga:"Why \u003Cspan\u003EChoose\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E Global Impact \u003Cbr\u003EMiddle School? ",nedenygatext:"Global Impact Middle School is a 1-year social innovation program specially designed for middle school students. It aims to cultivate double winged youth, who are sensitive to world’s problems and can devise tech driven solutions. The stars witness YGA Dream Partners, such as Mehmet Toner, Aziz Sancar and develop their double winged identity by taking different responsibilities in YGA’s Worldwide Award-Winning social innovations.  ",icontitle1:e,icontext1:"Student gain awareness of the problems present in the world and take responsibility to offer solutions to these problems.  They work as a team on the social innovations receiving worldwide awards that YGA graduates bring to life. The stars ideas are cared for and used by YGA graduates to improve these innovations.",icontitle2:"Real World Entrepreneur Skills",icontext2:"They gain the necessary skills for double winged entrepreneurship such as design thinking, storytelling, product design, pitching, campaign design, networking. ",icontitle3:"Academic Partnership  ",icontext3:"Global Impact Program is developed in partnership with Columbia Business School and London Business School. ",icontitle4:f,icontext4:"Students receive mentorship from Program Graduates, who received more than 1.000 hours of training from Dream Partners and YGA Graduates. Also, they are currently studying abroad. They gain deep awareness of themselves by receiving feed forwards.",stepdate1:"DEC-JAN'22",stepdesc1:g,stepdesc2:"5 students in a group ",stepdesc3:h,stepdesc4:i,stepdesc5:j,stepdesc6:"5 Know-How Sessions",stepdate2:"MAR-JUNE'22",step2desc1:"10 weeks online program",step2desc2:k,step2desc3:"Each week Online Meetings with Leader Coaches ",step2desc4:"Case studies & learnings from YGA Dream Partners & Graduates  ",step2desc5:"Preparation for the social innovation project to gaindeeper insight on understanding the present challenges in their societies ",step2desc6:"Real Life Focus:Social Innovation challenges from YGA Ventures ",step2desc7:"4 Know-How Sessions ",stepdate3:l,step3desc1:"5 days online program  ",step3desc2:"5 students in a group & 1-1 mentoring ",step3desc3:m,step3desc4:n,step3desc5:"Start Track - a student skill evaluation report  ",stepdate4:"NOV-OCT'21",step4desc1:g,step4desc2:k,step4desc3:i,step4desc4:h,step4desc5:j,stepdate5:l,step5desc1:m,step5desc2:n,step5desc3:"Yurtdışında okuyan YGA Mezun ve YGA’lı Girişimcilerle seanslar",step5desc4:f,step5desc5:"7 Know-How Sessions",stepTitle3:"Innovation Camp",sahadaOgrenmeTitle:e,sahadaOgrenmeText:"Working in Worldwide\u003Cbr\u003E Award-Winning\u003Cbr\u003E Social Innovations","çiftKanatlı":"Double Winged;","çiftKanatlıText":"Global Impact Middle School is a 1-year social innovation program specially designed for middle school students. It aims to cultivate double winged youth, who are sensitive to world’s problems and can devise tech driven solutions. The stars witness YGA Dream Partners, such as Mehmet Toner, Aziz Sancar and develop their double winged identity by taking different responsibilities in YGA’s Worldwide Award-Winning social innovations. ","fikirOdası":"Idea Room",fikirTitle1:"Fixed to Growth Mindset",fikirDesc1:"Recognize the role of being grateful and hopeful for learning. Learn to embrace failure and making mistakes as the best way to grow",fikirTitle2:"Dare to Challange",fikirDesc2:"Dare to step out of comfort zone and question the situation, self and others which brings new ideas",fikirTitle3:"Impactful Idea Generation",fikirDesc3:"Train yourself to thing big which bring impactful ideas is the key to change the world","projeOdası":"Project Room",projeTitle1:"Self-Awareness",projeDesc1:"Know yourself and your values to understand root causes behind your behaviorsa. Believe in yourself and keep developing ",projeTitle2:"Manage Unlimited Resources",projeDesc2:"Gather and use resources you needed responsibily. Develop kills for market research and digital world",projeTitle3:"Resilience against Uncertainty",projeDesc3:"Finding patterns in information & insufficent data. Re-frame problems. Develop skills for","aksiyonOdası":"Action Room",aksiyonTitle1:"Responsible Decision-Making",aksiyonDesc1:"Making bold decisions to solve the problems. Discover, discuss and deliver with the team to achieve together",aksiyonTitle2:"Public Speaking & Pitching",aksiyonDesc2:"Speak about own ideas as effectively as posibble. Develop skills of pitching to effect ",aksiyonTitle3:"Experiment Rapidly",aksiyonDesc3:"Learn through experience and by doing. Take responsiblility on the field and learn through feedbacks.","twinHakkında":"About Twin",twinText:"Twin is an instructive and fun robotics set, and online platform that develops children’s imagination. Thanks to the colorful and electronic blocks that can be easily combined, it simplifies the operating logic of technological devices that appear complex and makes them easier to understand. At the same time, it enables every child to access science content online with the Twing application. ","WeWalkHakkında":"About WeWalk",WeWalkText:"It is the world’s smartest white cane with revolutionary features developed for the visually impaired. WeWALK makes the conventional white cane innovative and smart, allowing visually impaired people to move more independently and safely. WeWALK was awarded the Edison award in the category of health and well-being in 2018. ",mezunTitle:"Program Graduates",sertifikaTitle:"Certification \u003Cbr\u003E& University\u003Cbr\u003E Application",sertifikaText:a,sertifikaPara1:"At the end of each step of the program a certificate of participation is given to the stars. Also, the stars, who successfully complete Global Impact Middle School’s 2-year social innovation program, are eligible to attend the YGA Summit, the first step of the YGA Global Impact High School Program application process. ",sertifikaPara2:"Also, they are considered to have referrals in the application process. Stars who successfully complete the Global Impact Middle School program can receive a special reference letter that can be used in the college application.",faq1:"What do you expect from parents throughout the program? ",faqt1text1:"At Global Impact Middle School, Leader Coaches guide stars throughout the program to raise their awareness on their social responsibility. However, we ask parents to ensure that the star’s calendar and weekly schedule are arranged accordingly to accommodate for the program. This is important to avoid the stars missing out in the completion of any challenges and attendance to online seminars.  ",faqt1text2:"Sometimes, we ask stars to interview their parents, friends or relatives. In such cases, we expect you to answer their questions. ",faq2:"How can my children use her\u002Fhis achievements in YGA in the international arena? ",faq2text:"One of the most important factors while applying universities is to show that children have a role in long lasting social responsibility projects. Recently, universities began to give credit to long lasting committed projects by the students. Thus, universities try to understand what skills students have developed over the years in YGA and how it affected on their personal development. Our stars should mention what they have achieved in the program and what progress they showed in terms of competency development in their motivation letter.  ",faq3:"Does being accepted to the Impact Lab program mean that my student is accepted to upcoming steps? ",faq3text:"Stars are closely observed by their Leader Coaches during the program and are evaluated based on their activity and participation rates. After the Impact Lab program, stars are sorted based on these evaluated criteria. Top 80 stars are then qualified for Deep Dive program. ",faq4:"Why it is a paid program?  ",faq4text:"Young Guru Academy is a non-profit organization.  YGA creates resources in 3 ways: sponsorships, individual donations, YGA equity from YGA projects. Global Impact Middle School is one of the projects that YGA creates equity. Program fee is used to cover all program costs. In the program, 1 in 5 students participate in the program with a scholarship awarded by YGA. Every year, thanks to our supporters and donors, we try to increase the number of scholarship children studying in the program and to grow more double winged young people. ",faq5:"If my student doesn’t complete each step of Global Impact Middle School, will he be able to get a certificate?  ",faq5text:"The stars receive a certificate after completing each step within the program.",faq6:"How many hours will my children needs to reserve weekly for the programs. ",faq6text:"An average of 1.5 – 2 hours per week is enough for stars to complete the program. Live broadcasts are usually taking place in the afternoon so that they are not overlap with school time. When it comes to the challenges, students usually have a week before they need to submit. Online meeting hours determined according to student's availability.",faqTitle:"Frequently Asked\u003Cbr\u003EQuestions","acıklama":"Description",programUcreti:"2020-2021 Fee",odemePaketi:"Payment Package",toplam:"Total",toplamOdemePaketi:"Total Payment Package",price1:o,price4:o,price2:"\u003Cb\u003E800\u003C\u002Fb\u003E €",price3:"\u003Cb\u003E1.00\u003C\u002Fb\u003E €",hedefTitle:"Objectives Of\u003Cbr\u003E The Program",hedefText:"Global Impact Middle School is a 1-year social innovation program specially designed for middle school students. It aims to cultivate double winged youth, who are sensitive to world’s problems and can devise tech driven solutions. The stars witness YGA Dream Partners, such as Mehmet Toner, Aziz Sancar and develop their double winged identity by taking different responsibilities in YGA’s Worldwide Award-Winning social innovations. Global Impact is a cumulative program that starts with the Middle School Program and continues until the end of the university.\u003Cbr\u003E *In GIms we call students as 'Star'.",kazanimTitle:"Which Competencies Does \u003Cbr\u003E Global Impact Program Offer?","kazanımText":"Harvard University names 3 rooms in its recipe for success. YGA Program aims to raise stars, who make the best of these three rooms, who dream and who design projects and implement them.",galleryText:"These competencies to be gained on the path of becoming Double-Winged Entrepreneurs producing a world-wide effect will be internalized and realized by our stars while taking responsibilities in YGA social innovation projects.",liderKocTitle:"Role Modeling\u003Cbr\u003E By Leader\u003Cbr\u003E Coaches",mailKatilim:"Subscribe\u003Cbr\u003E Our Mail List \u003Cbr\u003EFor Updates",mailKatilimText:"You will be hearing about our campaigns,\u003Cbr\u003E events and news from our graduated students' startups.",footerBold:"\u003Cb\u003EYGA\u003C\u002Fb\u003E is an NGO in 501-c status",ssprogramUcreti:"*Social Innovation Camp 2020-2021 Fee",fiziksel:"Physically",hemenBasvur:"Apply Now !",subscribe:"Subscribe",footerTitle:"Program Registration",footerDesc:"Global Impact Program Applications \u003Cbr\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan\u003Ewill start on September 2021\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E. \u003Cbr\u003EYou must fill the form. ",sonBasvuru:"Last Date For The Application \u003Cspan\u003EOctober 5, 2021\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E",epostaGonder:"Send E-mail",koordinator:"Global Impact Program Coordinator",wingedText:"Global Impact is a cumulative program which starts with middle school and continues till the end of university.",box1mini:p,box1:"Working in Worldwide\u003Cbr\u003E Award-Winning Social Innovations",box4mini:q,box4:r,box2:"Opportunity of accessing\u003Cbr\u003E Global Network",box3:"Developing Accurate\u003Cbr\u003E Skills to Create\u003Cbr\u003E Social Innovaitons",kimkatilabilir:"Who \u003Cbr\u003ECan Join?",katilimText:"Global Impact Middle School is designed for \u003Cb\u003E7th graders\u003C\u002Fb\u003E who want to improve both themselves and the world. The stars witness YGA Dream Partners, such as Mehmet Toner, Aziz Sancar and develop their double winged identity by taking different responsibilities in YGA’s Worldwide Award-Winning social innovations. Global Impact is a cumulative program that starts with the Middle School Program and continues until the end of the university.",basvuruTitle:"Global Impact Middle\u003Cbr\u003E School Application",veliadd:" Name Surname",digerOkul:s,veliepostaa:" E-mail",dogumTarihi:"Date of Birth",okul:"School Name",sinif:"Class",sehir:"City",velitell:" Phone",dosyaYukle:"Upload",schoolName:"\u003Cb\u003ESchool\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Name",studentName:"\u003Cb\u003EStudent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Name Surname",studentMail:"\u003Cb\u003EStudent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E E-mail",studentTel:"\u003Cb\u003EStudent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Phone",ihtiyacBursu:"Need Scholarship",formText:"Your selected scholarship document must be in \u003Cb\u003EPNG, JPG and PDF \u003C\u002Fb\u003E formats and the file size must not exceed \u003Cb\u003E3 mb\u003C\u002Fb\u003E.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EStudents who study at their schools with a need scholarship have the right to apply for a YGA scholarship. In order to apply for YGA scholarship, upload the document from your school stating the scholarship rate and type to the section above.​ \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EScholarship application results will be announced by e-mail after evaluation by the YGA board of directors.",kvkktext:"Policy on the protection and processing of personal data",kvkktext2:"   I have read, I approve.",gelecek:"Social innovation program raising the biplane youth of the future",required:"This field is required.",wrongPhone:"Wrong phone format",wrongEmail:"Wrong e-mail format",characterErr:"You must enter at least 2 characters",enterAs:"Enter as Name and Surname.",successtext:t,successtextt:t,anasayfayagit:"Go to homepage",kapat:"Close",mezunDesc:"Students who complete all three steps of the program become Global Impact Middle School graduates.",kvkklink:"Protection of Personal Data ",kvkklink2:"Privacy Policy ",kvkklink3:"Terms Of Use ",homelinks:"The technologies of YGA such as the world-recognized \u003Ca href='https:\u002F\u002Fwewalk.io\u002Ftr\u002F' target='_blank'\u003EWeWalk\u003C\u002Fa\u003E Smart Cane, Turkey first floating solar energy system Hydrosolar and early science love improver \u003Ca href='https:\u002F\u002Fwww.twinscience.com\u002Ftr\u002F' target='_blank'\u003ETwin\u003C\u002Fa\u003E Science Set are all based on the ideas developed in this program.",howImprove:q,rolModel:r,roleText:"Witnessing right models is one of the most important parts of the program. In online programs, Stars benefit from the videos, the real-life stories and experiences of YGA Dream Partners. In summer camps, stars attend to Dream Partners keynote speeches and ask their questions regarding their camp project. ",deneyimText:"Stars develop 21’st century skills by taking responsibility in YGA’s social innovation projects. In the camps, they develop social innovation projects as a team to improve YGA’s social innovations. After careful reviewing and consideration, these projects are then put into use to improve the current worldwide-award winning social innovations of YGA by its Graduates.  This allows stars to witness the value of the projects they work on during the program and make a direct impact on their societies. ",deneyimTitle:"Working in Worldwide \u003Cbr\u003EAward-Winning\u003Cbr\u003E Social Innovations",deneyimSmall:p,anaText:"YGA Dream Partners, initiatives, volunteers and high school and university student attendees from all over the world… YGA Summit brings you together with double-winged entrepreneurs, projects and inspiring names every year.       ",anaTitle:"YGA Summit 2021",anasayfa:"Homepage",ygazirvesi:"YGA Summit",katilimci:"Participants",konusmaci:"Speakers",ulkedenKatilimci:"Countries",izlenme:"Hours of Views ",interaktif:"Interactive Sessions",years:"\u003Cspan\u003EYGA\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E Summit \u003Cbr\u002F\u003Ein 20 Years",ygaGonulluleri:"YGA Volunteers",hayalort:"We have mentors who are devoting their time,\u003Cu\u003Eknow-how and energy to us.\u003C\u002Fu\u003E ",ortaklar:u,ortaklarText:"Bu sene Zirve'de konuk edeceğimiz Hayal Ortaklarımızla Discord ve diğer platformlarımız üzerinden etkileşime geçmeye hazır olun !",konusmacilar:"YGA Summit 2022 Speakers",tumKonusmacilar:"All Speakers",keytext:"Every year, leading names in the fields of science, art, business, entrepreneurship and technology take place as speakers at YGA Summit.",tarih:"28 February 2021",cumartesi:"Saturday",Acilis:"Opening",simdiBasvur:"REGISTER",birlik:"Strategic Partners",birlikText:"Brands helping us reach to the thousands of young people",ygaGonulluleriText:"YGA Gönüllüleri de Zirve'de seni bekliyor ! Discord üzerinden etkileşime geçmeye hazır olun !",veliad:"\u003Cb\u003EParent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Name Surname",velieposta:"\u003Cb\u003EParent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E E-mail",velitel:"\u003Cb\u003EParent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Phone",message:"Message",koc1title:"Boston University,\u003Cbr\u003E Computer Engenering and Philosophy",koc1desc:"What excites me the most is learning with the stars. It is delightful and refreshing to explore, research, and develop together.",koc2title:"Georgia Institute of Technology,\u003Cbr\u003E Mechanical Engineering",koc2desc:"Each star has a different interest area. The projects and ideas which they produce by using them are at the university level. I am so lucky to work with them.",koc3title:"Koç University,\u003Cbr\u003E Electrical and Electronic Engineering",koc3desc:"In this program, the stars learn to succeed and develop together as a team. In the YGA climate, they learn how to give feedback to each other and me.",koc4title:" Bilkent University,\u003Cbr\u003E Mechanical Engineering",koc4desc:" It is inspiring to guide them on developing 21st-century skills and how they will benefit from their progress in the future. Thanks to the conscience wings of the stars, I can already see that the ideas and technologies they will develop in the future will be beneficial to humanity.",koclarlatanis:"Meet \u003Cbr\u003EOur Leader\u003Cbr\u003ECoaches",sixweeks:"6 Weeks Program",fourweeks:"4 Weeks Program",fivepeople:"5 Students in a group",gelceks:"Geleceğin çift kanatlı gençlerini yetiştiren sosyal inovasyon programı",haksiyonTitle1:"İnisiyatif Alma ve Hayata Geçirme",haksiyonTitle2:"Network (İlişki Ağı) Geliştirme",haksiyonTitle3:"Deneme - Yanılma ve Tanıklık ile Deneyim Kazanma",hprojeTitle1:"Özyeterlilik",hprojeTitle2:"Kaynakları Değerlendirme: Ekonomik,Dijital & İnsan",hprojeTitle3:"Belirsizlikle Başa Çıkabilme",hfikirTitle1:"Pozitif Bakış Açısı",hfikirTitle2:"Doğru Soruları Sorabilmek",hfikirTitle3:"Fırsatları Yakalama",gihs:"Global Impact \u003Cbr\u003EHigh School",hmtitle:"What is YGA?",hmdesc:v,hmdescl:"For YGA, a non-profit and non-governmental organization established in Turkey, “being double-winged” means not only being conscientious enough to design projects beneficial to humanity but also being adequately equipped to accomplish projects.",hmtitle2:"How to get involved, what   gains does it provide?",hmdesc2:a,hmdescl2:w,hmtitle3:"Why does YGA exist and what does it do?",hmdesc3:w,incele:"View",ygaprdesc:c,website:"Visit Website",ygagirisimleri:"YGA Startups",ygagirisimleridesc:"Technology-based startups founded by YGA alumni who have received over 5,000 hours of training at YGA.",ygaprizes:"YGA Awards",prizedesc:c,newslettertitle:"Join our mail group to stay\u003Cbr\u003E  informed about innovations at YGA.",newsletterdesc:"What will you receive from this mailing group?\u003Cbr\u003E Notifications on startups established by our alumni, school registration times and campaigns.",gonder:"Send",adress:"E-mail",finansallar:"Financials",reports:x,reportsingle:"Annual Report",hayalortaklari:u,kurul:"\u003Cb\u003EYGA\u003C\u002Fb\u003E, is an international NGO founded in Turkey.",icra:"Executive Board",ygaofis:"YGA Office",mezunara:"Search for Alumni at YGA",ara:"Search",aradesc:"*You can search for YGA Alumni by name, surname or project criteria by adding “,”.",ygaligirisimciler:"YGA Entrepreneurs",tummezun:"All Our Alumni",more:"Load More",yillikrep:x,yillikrepdesc:c,denetimRep:"Audit Reports",dernekb:"Association Statements",offices:"YGA Offices",smap:"Show on Map",cform:"Contact",ozyegin:"Özyeğin University",london:"YGA London",italy:"YGA Italy",vent:"YGA Ventures",devaminioku:"Read More",sosyalMedya:"Social Media",tanitim:"Project Video",gimsfirst:"Objectives Of\u003Cbr\u003EThe Program",gimsfdetail:"Global Impact Middle School is a 1-year social innovation program specially designed for middle school students. It aims to cultivate double winged youth, who are sensitive to world’s problems and can devise tech driven solutions. The stars witness YGA Dream Partners, such as Mehmet Toner, Aziz Sancar and develop their double winged identity by taking different responsibilities in YGA’s Worldwide Award-Winning social innovations. Global Impact is a cumulative program that starts with the Middle School Program and continues until the end of the university.\u003Cbr\u003E*In GIms we call students as 'Star'.",paylas:d,gihsmezunt:"Students who complete the two-year Global Impact High School program become eligible to graduate from the program.",gihst1:"Ensure that children with limited opportunities but unlimited dreams meet with science!",gihsd1:"In science sessions, high school students improve their confidence by teaching children with limited opportunities how to conduct their own projects with Twin Science Kits. They show them that science is not complicated. They evoke curiosity in children transforming its difficult, distant and boring perception into something fun, accessible and exciting. ​ ​",filmiizle:"Watch the Film",yetkinliks:"What Compentecies Will You Develop in the Program?",destekle:"Support",cookiepol:"By using our website you allow cookies. For detailed information, you can review our \u003Ca target='_blank' href='https:\u002F\u002Fyga.org.tr\u002Fcms\u002Fyga_cerez_politikasi.pdf'\u003E Cookie Policy.\u003C\u002Fa\u003E ",kabul:"Accept",cerezp:"Cookie Policy",aluwork:"Where Do YGA Alumni Work?",isbtitle:"Students Participating in Strategic Partnership Projects",isbdesc:"YGA offers a uniquely practical learning experience to the world's best universities.",zirvet1:"At YGA Summit 2021,\u003Cbr\u003Ewe will upside:",zirved1:"Session Themes",zirved2:"YGA Volunteers are waiting for you at YGA Summit! Get ready to get in contact with YGA Volunteers on Discord",okuls:"School Select",programkyt:"YGA Program\u003Cbr\u003ERegister Forms",formtxt:v,okulpl:"Choose School",ortaokul:"Middle School",lise:"High School",uni:"University",programpl:"Choose Program",bilimlebl:y,sinifs:"Choose Class",hazirl:"Preparation",sehirs:"Choose City",ogrencidt:"\u003Cb\u003EStudent\u003C\u002Fb\u003E Birthdate",nexts:"Next Step",bilimblsf:"Meet with\u003Cbr\u003EScience",okulerr:"Choose a school or write school name.",cinsiyet:"Gender",cinsiyets:"Choose",erkk:"Male",kiz:"Female",other:s,notwant:"Don't want to specify",okultp:"School Type",devletOk:"Public",ozelok:"Private",okuladig:"Enter other school name",questans:"\u003Cb\u003EWhy do you want to join the Global Impact College program? \u003C\u002Fb\u003EIf you wish, you can also answer with a video.",bilimlebulus:y,bilimlebulusp:"Meet with Science\u003Cbr\u003EProgram",bolum:"Section",ulke:"Country",mesajtxt:"Write your message...",giub:"Global Impact University\u003Cbr\u003EProgram Application",bolums:"Choose Section",neredend:"Where did you hear about us?",gimsson:"Application deadline \u003Cspan\u003E27 June 2021\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E",bayer:"*Children of Bayer employees can benefit and participate in the project, but they cannot be among the selected people.",programdirect:"Program Director",bilimtarih:"Deadline for application \u003Cspan\u003EJanuary 24, 2022\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E",gihsfoot:"Program applications closed on \u003Cb\u003E10 December 2021\u003C\u002Fb\u003E.",unidesc:"To join the Global Impact University Program, simply fill out the form below!",unikoord:"Global Impact University Program Coordinator",unison:"Program registration closed on \u003Cspan\u003E January 23.\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E",howto:"How to become a\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Cspan\u003EYGA\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E volunteer?",howtop:"Did you know that YGA has various programs designed specifically for different age groups? Go to the programs section now and discover the right program for you!",odull:"Awards, News and Business Partners",odult:"YGA youths develop their wings while implementing technology-based innovations that benefits humanity.",shareurl:"https:\u002F\u002Fyga.org.tr\u002Fen\u002Fprojects\u002F",pirireh:"Piri Guides",ygakur:"Startups Founded by YGA Graduates",kurull:"YGA Board",milyont:"100 Million",tiktoki:"Tiktok Views",simdiBasvurr:z,hemenBasvurr:z,ogren1:"learn from each other,",ogren2:"shares their experiences,",ogren3:"having fun together,",ogren4:"inspired by the world.",ogren:"YGA\u003Cbr\u003E Alumni",earthtext:" YGA's Earthshot Prize Advisory Board",earthtitle:"Advisory Board",metacift:"Raises double-winged youth",etkinlikt:"Turkey's \u003Cbr\u003EMost Interesting \u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EYouth Event\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E",etktext:"Every year, the YGA Summit brings together 50,000 university and high school students who meet to accomplish firsts that will benefit humanity.",etkico1:"World-renowned Speakers",etkico2:"Each year, prominent names from science, art, sports, business, entrepreneurship and technology fields join the YGA Summit as speakers.",etkico3:"Firsts and Innovations",etkico4:"The YGA Summit also features “firsts” as part of an enriching event experience! Summit participants experience many firsts together from unlimited interaction on the Discord server to collectively produced works of art.      ",etkico5:"Inspirational Themes",etkico6:"Each YGA Summit includes a key theme that determines the path for today and tomorrow. During the summit, participants join talks and activities that will enable them to internalize the theme and take action.",etkico7:"A Genuine Ecosystem",etkico8:"Summit participants meet with others as well as YGA Dream Partners, YGA volunteers, and YGA office staff. We always find a way to meet whether the summit is physical or online!",price5:a,price6:a,price7:a,howtob:"Become a YGA volunteer!",summitPreTitle:"YGA Summit\u003Cbr\u003EPre-Registration",summitPreNameSurname:"Name Surname",summitPrePhone:"Phone",summitPreEmail:"E-Mail",summitPreSuccess:"Your application has been successfully submitted.",zirveBasvur:"Apply Summit!",ygaprojeleri:"YGA Projects",summitLogoTitle:"Gold Sponsors",meetIsBayer:"Does your family work at Bayer?",meetIsBayerTrue:"Yes",meetIsBayerFalse:"No"}}}}}}("",null,"YGA youths develop their wings while implementing technology-based innovations that benefit humanity.","Share","Field Base Learning","One-to-one Mentoring","10 weeks online program  ","Each week Online Meetings with Leader Coaches on.  ","Science Movement Campaign (YGA’s project which aims Is to meet science content and education with disadvantaged children.) ","Stem Quest (online science quiz) with disadvantaged children ","5 students in a group","JUL'22","Designing a social innovation project with Design Sprints Technique, which is a key technique adopted by credible companies such as Google, to create new products.","Inspiring speeches from YGA Dream Partners & Graduates ","\u003Cb\u003E200\u003C\u002Fb\u003E €","Field Base Learning:","Witnessing the Right Role Models: ","YGA Dream Partners","Other","Your application has been successfully received.","Dream Partners","YGA raises double-winged youth who help us look to the future with hope.","YGA programs are not limited to students in Turkey. Also, students from universities such as Harvard, MIT, Columbia, Brown, Berkeley, London Business School, Technical University of Munich, Turin Polytechnic take part in its projects as part of strategic partnerships.","Annual Reports","Meet with Science","Pre-registration!"));</script><script src="/_nuxt/4631548.js" defer></script><script src="/_nuxt/f4c941e.js" defer></script></body></html>